班，再见！”后来大家慢慢知道了这件事，有人不理解问郑彦强：“她买咱的面粉，大冷的天，咱送去她又不要了，退货自己又不来拿钱，咱一分钱没赚又赔上那么多时间和力气，值吗？”郑彦强说：“这次她没买我们的东西，可下次呢？以后呢？只要我们把服务和各方面工作都做好，顾客就一定会来而且常来。不管顾客有什么要求，我们的职责就是让每一位顾客满意！不能用顾客给我们带来多少利润来衡量服务的标准。”他的话，让我们领悟到了服务的真谛。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_229_546_612_959.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"32%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 雷锋服务队的故事\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_609_1138_726.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_134_1084_254.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//bc0251e2-4350-48fc-86aa-b5f173940211/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_134_1084_254.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A00%3A18Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff88435797fc492f7b5a76be55b10fb52ddb2c12d1573e2d030bd2cd455eccaaa", "imgs/img_in_image_box_229_546_612_959.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//bc0251e2-4350-48fc-86aa-b5f173940211/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_229_546_612_959.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A00%3A18Z%2F-1%2F%2F455cd8de3f9e47126e3a58161da4d04c0ac406a5bc9945ea97b764f3ccfdaf39", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_609_1138_726.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//bc0251e2-4350-48fc-86aa-b5f173940211/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_609_1138_726.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A00%3A18Z%2F-1%2F%2Fd9c3de57afa7cc9d3e95749a5e5d781355a1e9a1ae677cbac8cce40faca885f0"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//bc0251e2-4350-48fc-86aa-b5f173940211/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A00%3A19Z%2F-1%2F%2Fa07d98f6781009b76d8a646006af0e4011f09eae231246f83e7dcf5e3d3